      "title": "Upper-Division Writing Requirement",
      "rule": {
        "manualCheck": "Present a dossier of a minimum of two papers of at least three to five pages each, submitted to the FRN Program Coordinator before the second semester of the junior year. Papers may be research papers written in English for any Stony Brook course, graded papers preferred; otherwise translate two FRN paper from French to English.",
        "type": "course",
        "code": "FRN 459"
      },
      "sourceText": "To demonstrate proficiency in writing English, students majoring in French must register for the 0-credit FRN 459 and present a dossier of a minimum of two papers of at least three to five pages each. The dossier must be submitted before the second semester of the junior year to the FRN Program Coordinator."
    },
